(2) have facilities adequate to provide local program production and origination;
(3) employ a minimum of 1-1/2 professional radio staff persons or the equivalent in part-time staff and agree to employ a minimum of 1-1/2 professional radio staff persons or the equivalent in part-time staff throughout the fiscal year of the grant;
